<!-- Foreground of the adaptive icon: the bus of art/bus-app.svg, without the
     background plate. Converted by hand from the SVG, which uses nothing but
     <path>. The group brings the drawing's 1024 grid into the 108 dp canvas.

     Safe zone: on a 108 dp canvas, only the central 66 dp disc is guaranteed
     visible, which is 33 dp of radius. The drawing is scaled so that its point
     furthest from the centre lands at 30.5 dp, which leaves some margin. That
     margin is not a luxury: some launchers, MIUI in particular, enlarge third
     party icons on top of the mask, and a drawing pinned right on the limit
     gets sliced.

     If the drawing changes, recompute the scale and the translation from the
     centre of its bounding box and its maximum radius. -->
